{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af14a93","nodeId":"uFeiTRobSymkvCinhwmZV","roadmapSlug":"data-engineer","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.672Z","description":"# AWS SNS\n\nAmazon SNS (Simple Notification Service) is a fully managed pub/sub messaging service from AWS. It allows a single message to be sent to multiple subscribers simultaneously through topics. SNS is commonly used alongside SQS to fan out messages to multiple queues or trigger downstream processing in Lambda functions and data pipelines.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Amazon Simple Notification Service (SNS)","url":"http://aws.amazon.com/sns/","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf526f"},{"type":"official","title":"Send Fanout Event Notifications","url":"https://aws.amazon.com/getting-started/hands-on/send-fanout-event-notifications/","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5270"},{"type":"article","title":"What is Pub/Sub Messaging?","url":"https://aws.amazon.com/what-is/pub-sub-messaging/","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5271"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:58.294Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417044","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Engineer in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/WOP6XG"},{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417100","title":"DataCamp - Data Engineer in Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/JkYLbr"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-engineer/content/uFeiTRobSymkvCinhwmZV.md"}